  "fields": {
    "title": "Mobile First",
    "textContent": {
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Description",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "heading-3"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "value": "Mobile First",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": ", as the name suggests, means that a website or app is first designed for mobile devices which has more restrictions, then expand its features to create a tablet or desktop version. This is not only useful, because mobile displays have more restrictions (because of their size), but also because today websites are displayed more on smartphone than desktop. Early in 2012, smartphone sales have overtaken PC sales, and in 2016 mobile internet usage has surpassed desktop usage in 2016.",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "70OjTaWkbJpbD8QsbmxzFb",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "value": "[1]",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "But ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "value": "mobile first ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "is not only about layouting for different display sizes, it also has consequences for the content of a website. Stephanie and Bryan Rieger encapsulated the ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "value": "Mobile First",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " responsive design approach: ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ],
                  "value": "»The lack of a media query is your first media query.«",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "blockquote"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "In this context, ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "value": "Mobile First",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " is less about mobile devices per se, but instead focuses on prioritising content and tasks regardless of the device. If you can prioritise your content and make it work within the confined space of a small screen, then you will have created a robust, resilient design that you can build upon for larger screen sizes.",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "2RUyiXeBDUSEY6Z3EJcWYt",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "value": "[2]",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " To make your website ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "2ABYnMzPbdcoVRHCQpEav8",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "responsive",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " of your design, you can use for example ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "6Nc9jvBRCAEoyS4EDF9O6E",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "media queries",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": ".",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Background",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "heading-3"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": "Luke Wroblewski coined the term ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "value": "Mobile First",
              "nodeType": "text"
            },
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [],
              "value": " in response to the ascendency of mobile devices in 2010. ",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "content": [
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "»Losing 80% of your screen space forces you to focus. You need to make sure that what stays on the screen is the most important set of features for your customers and your business. There simply isn’t room for any interface debris or content of questionable value. You need to know what matters most.« ",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                },
                {
                  "data": {
                    "target": {
                      "sys": {
                        "id": "2HoqCMV6m0tcuKc1HFTcIB",
                        "type": "Link",
                        "linkType": "Entry"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "data": {},
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "superscript"
                        }
                      ],
                      "value": "[3]",
                      "nodeType": "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink"
                },
                {
                  "data": {},
                  "marks": [],
                  "value": "",
                  "nodeType": "text"
                }
              ],
              "nodeType": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "blockquote"
        },
        {
